  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "PMH significant for diabetes, CAD s/p CABG and vascular dementia\nwho presented to OSH (___) with speech\nchanges; at OSH she underwent ___ which showed an\nacute/subacute infarct in left temporoparietal region with a\npetechial hemorrhage.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=450-686",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She was transferred to ___ for further\nmanagement of her acute stroke.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=687-757",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "According to her daughter, the nursing staff at ___ at",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=761-815",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "___ have noted a change over the past 2 weeks, she was\nsupposedly not acting like herself.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=816-906",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "This past ___ (5 days\nago), she was noted by the nurses to be looking at them but not\nresponding, so she was taken to ___\nthey did not perform any imaging studies, diagnosed her with\nbronchitis and chronic dementia and sent her back to her\nfacility.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=907-1156",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s7",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "According to her daughter, on ___ she was able to\nspeak clearly, but occasionally had word finding difficulties.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=1157-1269",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s8",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "It\nis unclear at this time exactly how she progressed in the \ninterim\nfrom leaving the ED on ___ and today.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=1271-1378",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s9",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "However, he daughter\nnotes that when talking to her on the phone this morning, her\nspeech was \"garbled.\" She was unsure if there was a lack of\ncomprehension, but she did say that the nurses said she was not\nreacting to them when they asked her to eat or take her\nmedications; likely indicating a lack of comprehension.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=1379-1697",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s10",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Given\nthat her speech was no longer made up of clear words, though did\nnot appear to be slurred, she was brought back to the ED today,\nwhere the CT head demonstrated the infarct.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=1698-1876",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s11",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Of note, on arrival\nto OSH ED, her blood sugar was 45, so she was given D50W with no\nsignificant change.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=1877-1981",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s12",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "At baseline, patient does not know the date or where she is.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=1984-2044",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s13",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "There is a nurse who sees her daily, but the patient never \nremembers her name.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=2046-2125",
   "needs": []
  },
