   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s11",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "IMAGING:",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=4488-4496",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s12",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "HEAD CT:",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=4497-4505",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s13",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Left temporal hypodensity with punctate areas of hyperdensity \ncompatible with infarction with small foci of hemorrhage.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=4506-4626",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s14",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "No \nsignificant \nchange from prior examination",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=4627-4673",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s15",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "CTA HEAD AND NECK",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=4676-4693",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s16",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "1. Moderate atherosclerosis, with most severe involvement of the \nright \nexternal carotid artery origin, and less severe but prominent \ninvolvement of \nthe left common and left subclavian artery origins and of the \ndescending \naorta.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=4694-4927",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s17",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "There is no evidence of flow-limiting stenosis of the \ninternal carotid \narteries.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=4928-5010",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s18",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "2. No large vessel occlusion or flow-limiting stenosis within \nthe brain.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=5015-5088",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s19",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "No aneurysm greater than 2 mm.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=5089-5119",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s20",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "3. Subacute left MCA territory cortical infarct, involving the \ntemporal more than parietal lobe, with small foci of increased \ndensity, similar to prior, most likely spared \"islands\" of \npreserved cortex.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=5124-5329",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s21",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "4. Mild interlobular septal thickening (some of which may be \nsecondary to \nexpiratory timing of the acquisition) and borderline mediastinal \nadenopathy, partially visualized.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=5334-5509",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s22",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Correlation with history, \nphysical examination and PA and lateral CXR is suggested to \nexclude an infectious or inflammatory pulmonary process, or \nunderlying interstitial lung disease.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=5510-5696",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s23",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "5. Other, likely incidental, findings include paranasal sinus \ndisease, status post CABG, and osseous degenerative changes, \nmost prominent in the cervical spine.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=5702-5864",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s24",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "ECHOCARDIOGRAM",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=5867-5881",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s25",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The left atrium and right atrium are normal in cavity size.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=5882-5941",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s26",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "No \natrial septal defect or patent foramen ovale is seen by 2D, \ncolor Doppler or saline contrast at rest (unable to cooperate \nwith maneuvers).",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=5942-6086",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s27",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Left ventricular wall thicknesses and cavity \nsize are normal.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=6087-6149",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s28",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "There is mild regional left ventricular \nsystolic dysfunction with focal severe hypokinesis of the distal \ninferior and septal walls and apex.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=6150-6292",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s29",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "No discrete left ventricular \napical aneurysm is seen The remaining segments contract normally",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=6293-6387",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s30",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "(LVEF = 55 %).",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=6389-6403",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s31",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The estimated cardiac index is normal",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=6404-6441",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s32",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "(>=2.5L/min/m2).",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=6443-6459",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s33",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "No masses or thrombi are seen in the left \nventricle.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=6460-6513",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s34",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Right ventricular chamber size and free wall motion \nare normal.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=6514-6578",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s35",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The aortic valve leaflets (3) appear structurally \nnormal with good leaflet excursion and no aortic regurgitation.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=6579-6693",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s36",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The mitral valve leaflets are mildly thickened.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=6695-6742",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s37",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Physiologic \nmitral regurgitation is seen (within normal limits).",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=6743-6808",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s38",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "There is \nmild pulmonary artery systolic hypertension.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=6809-6863",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s39",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "There is no \npericardial effusion.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=6864-6898",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s40",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "IMPRESSION: Normal left ventricular cavity size with mild \nregional systolic dysfunction c/w CAD.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=6901-6998",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s41",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Mild pulmonary artery \nsystolic hypertension.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=6999-7044",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s42",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "No definite cardiac source of embolism \nidentified.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=7045-7096",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s1",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "___ YO RHW with history of vascular dementia presents with \ndifficulty speaking.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=7124-7204",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "On intial evaluation, she is awake, largely mute, with \noccasional coherent sentences containing paraphasic errors.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=7207-7322",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She \nfollowed 1 midline command once.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=7323-7360",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She did\nnot follow any other verbal commands.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=7361-7406",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "CN: II-XII were intact.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=7407-7430",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "It\nwas difficult to determine if she had a field cut.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=7431-7484",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s7",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She did not\nblink to threat on either side.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=7485-7528",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s8",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She moved all 4 extremities \nwell.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=7529-7563",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s9",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Toes were down.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=7564-7579",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s10",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Labs were noted for Hgb/HCT 10.7/32.3; BUN/CREAT",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=7580-7628",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s11",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "43/1.3.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=7630-7637",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s12",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "CT showed a left temporal infarct with a small area of \nhemorrhagic transformation.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=7638-7721",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s13",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Vessel imaging did not reveal any \nsignificant occlusion or thrombus to explain the stroke.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=7722-7813",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s14",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Her infarct sppears to be embolic.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=7816-7850",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s15",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Her echocardiogram did \ndemonstrate hypokinesis inferiorly and akinesis at the apex, \nwhich likely caused stasis and clot formation.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=7851-7983",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s16",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "We felt this was \nan indication for anticoagulation.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=7984-8036",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s17",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Telemetry revealed no atrial \nfibrillation.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=8037-8080",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s18",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "However, given the hemorrhagic conversion, she was not started \non anticoagulation at this time.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=8081-8177",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s20",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She will be safe to start on coumadin on ___.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=8273-8318",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s21",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She should be \nstarted on 5 mg for 3 days then have an INR checked.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=8319-8386",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s22",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Her INR \ngoal is ___.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=8387-8408",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s23",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She should remain on Plavix as a bridge until her",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=8409-8458",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s24",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "INR is therapeutic.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=8460-8479",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s25",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "HGbA1c was 8.6, lipid panel showed total cholesterol 161, HDL",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=8482-8543",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s26",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "76, LDL 70.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=8545-8556",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s27",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Her mild acute kidney injury resolved with fluids.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=8557-8607",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s28",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Blood sugars were labile.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=8609-8634",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s29",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She was continued on her home regimen \non NPH with humalog sliding scale.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=8635-8708",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s30",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She was occasionally \nhypoglycemic at 06:00, so her evening NPH dose was lowered from",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=8709-8794",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s31",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "9 to 8 units.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=8796-8809",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s32",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She often did not eat breakfast, so her NPH was \nhalved for this.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=8810-8875",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s33",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
