   "section": "COND",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Level of Consciousness: Alert and interactive.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=10388-10434",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:COND:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "COND",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Activity Status: Ambulatory - requires assistance or aid (walker \nor cane).",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=10435-10510",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:COND:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "COND",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Neuro Status: global aphasia",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12904769-DS-20:chars=10511-10539",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:12904769-RR-14:s1",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2117-10-12T04:15:00",
   "text": "Left temporal hypodensity with punctate areas of hyperdensity compatible with infarction with small foci of hemorrhage.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=12904769-RR-14:chars=1006-1125",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:12904769-RR-14:s2",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2117-10-12T04:15:00",
   "text": "No significant change from prior examination.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=12904769-RR-14:chars=1127-1172",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:12904769-RR-16:s1",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2117-10-14T10:36:00",
   "text": "1. Moderate atherosclerosis, with most severe involvement of the right external carotid artery origin, and less severe but prominent involvement of the left common and left subclavian artery origins and of the descending aorta.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=12904769-RR-16:chars=3905-4133",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:12904769-RR-16:s2",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2117-10-14T10:36:00",
   "text": "There is no evidence of flow-limiting stenosis of the internal carotid arteries.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=12904769-RR-16:chars=4135-4215",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:12904769-RR-16:s3",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2117-10-14T10:36:00",
   "text": "2. No large vessel occlusion or flow-limiting stenosis within the brain.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=12904769-RR-16:chars=4217-4290",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:12904769-RR-16:s4",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2117-10-14T10:36:00",
   "text": "No aneurysm greater than 2 mm.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=12904769-RR-16:chars=4292-4322",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:12904769-RR-16:s5",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2117-10-14T10:36:00",
   "text": "3. Subacute left MCA territory cortical infarct, involving the temporal more than parietal lobe, with small foci of increased density, similar to prior, most likely spared \"islands\" of preserved cortex.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=12904769-RR-16:chars=4324-4527",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:12904769-RR-16:s6",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2117-10-14T10:36:00",
   "text": "4. Mild interlobular septal thickening (some of which may be secondary to expiratory timing of the acquisition) and borderline mediastinal adenopathy, partially visualized.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=12904769-RR-16:chars=4529-4702",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:12904769-RR-16:s7",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2117-10-14T10:36:00",
   "text": "Correlation with history, physical examination and PA and lateral CXR is suggested to exclude an infectious or inflammatory pulmonary process, or underlying interstitial lung disease.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=12904769-RR-16:chars=4703-4886",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:12904769-RR-16:s8",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2117-10-14T10:36:00",
   "text": "5. Other, likely incidental, findings include paranasal sinus disease, status post CABG, and osseous degenerative changes, most prominent in the cervical spine.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=12904769-RR-16:chars=4889-5050",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
